## ✨ Features

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Add tasks** | Type & press **Enter** or click **Add** |
| **Complete tasks** | Click the checkbox to toggle done/undone |
| **Edit tasks** | Click ✏️, modify the text, then 💾 save |
| **Delete tasks** | Click 🗑️ to remove a task |
| **Filter** | Switch between **All / Active / Completed** |
| **Clear completed** | One-click button to remove all finished tasks |
| **Persistent storage** | Uses `localStorage` — tasks survive page refresh |
| **Stats bar** | Shows active, completed, and total counts |
| **Responsive** | Works on mobile & desktop |
| **Animated** | Smooth slide-in animation for new items |

## 🚀 How to use

1. Copy the code above into a file named **`todo.html`**
2. Open it in any browser — no server needed!
3. Start adding your tasks 🎉
